-- 142: SAMPLE-SELECTION SCENE — euclid + `n`, real claps, slowed 80s pop.
-- SAVED STATE (nice spot to come back to). Two ideas drive the rhythm section:
--   1. euclidean rhythm: `s "bd(3,8)"` is E(3,8) — 3 hits spread over 8 steps.
--      Rotations/other densities: cp(3,8,2), realclaps(5,16), hand(7,16).
--   2. sample selection / modulation with `n`: for a sample, `n` picks WHICH
--      file in the folder (bd:0, bd:1, …) and can be modulated over time:
--        n (slow 4 $ choose [0,1,2])    new kick sample every 4 cycles
--        n (choose [0,1,2,3])           pick per hit
--        speed (slow 3 $ range 1 1.4 sine)   playback-rate sweep
-- Claps: WAY more real claps — realclaps (4 files), ovenclaps (11), hand (17),
--   cp (2). `n` only varies a folder with more than one file, so realclaps/n is
--   real sample selection, not just pitch.
-- 80s pop on top (loud, dry), slowed 8x from the original: d7 is now `slow 16`
--   with `stut 4 0.5 0.5` stutter and a 128-cycle gain ramp (1.15..1.4).
--   d8 (Tears For Fears arpeggio) was CUT — it read as a quiet background
--   arp that cluttered the melody rather than supporting it.
--   d7 melody is Toto "Africa" (1982) chorus, tabs-tidal/Toto_-_Africa.gp3-*.
-- Pad (d9): vi-IV-I-V in F#m as WIDE INVERSIONS spanning octaves 3-5 — one
--   chord tone per octave, e.g. F#m = fs3 / a4 / cs5. The low triads
--   (fs3-a3-cs4) read as ultra-bassy and a tight high voicing was thin; this
--   spreads each chord across three octaves. Chords divide gain in SuperDirt,
--   so the pad needs a much higher `gain` than a single note; 3.0 was too loud,
--   settled at ~1.3. Fired every 2 cycles with long sustain/release (hoRhodes'
--   envelope caps ~2.8 s) so successive chords ring into each other.
-- Bass/kick tightened for space: short envelopes (kick release 0.09; bass
--   sustain 0.06 + lpf 900), kick hpf 42 gain 0.95, bass gain 0.32.
-- Group bus trims at runtime: drums 0.9, bass 0.8, music 1.25
--   (~groupCtl.set(gain, sDel, sVerb, sShim) in sclang; sends 0 = dry, which is
--   the fix for the reverb-on-the-kick).
-- Folders: 773 total in the sound library; scene uses 808bd, realclaps, cp,
--   ovenclaps, hand, hh + project dubsynth/hoRhodes.
-- Master chain (sc/dub_master.scd): hpf -> glue comp (ducked by kick) -> tape
--   saturation -> tone -> soft limiter (Limiter.ar 0.79) + guaranteed ceiling.
--   So compression/limiting IS on the master; `ceiling-used` in sc/master-meter.log
--   is the limiter headroom. Gains below were set by EAR (melody 0.9..1.0,
--   pad 0.9) because the meter only samples every 2 s and misses chord transients.
-- Melody: slow 8 + stut 4 0.5 0.5 (8x slower than the original take).
-- Pad (d9): F#m-D-A-E as wide inversions across octaves 3-5 — an earlier
--   experiment replaced these with A7/D7/E7 "blues chords", which was a
--   misreading (the ask was a blues FORM, not blues chords); reverted.
setcps 0.5

d1 $ s "808bd(3,8)" # n (slow 4 $ choose [0,1,2]) # gain 0.95 # shape 0.55 # hpf 42 # release 0.09 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d2 $ s "realclaps(5,16)" # n (choose [0,1,2,3]) # gain 0.9 # hpf 420 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d3 $ s "~ [cp cp] ~ [realclaps realclaps]" # n (choose [0,1,2,3]) # gain 0.85 # hpf 420 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d4 $ s "ovenclaps(5,16)" # n (choose [0,1,2,3]) # gain 0.45 # hpf 750 # pan 0.62 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d5 $ note "fs1*16" # s "dubsynth" # waveMix 0.5 # cutoff 160 # fenv 1.0 # drive 0.7 # sustain 0.06 # release 0.1 # lpf 900 # gain 0.32 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d6 $ s "hand(7,16)" # n (choose [0,1,2,3]) # gain 0.35 # speed (slow 3 $ range 1 1.4 sine) # pan 0.4 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d7 $ stut 4 0.5 0.5 $ slow 8 $ note "<[b4 e5 cs5 e5 b4 e5 cs5 b4 e5 cs5 b4 a4 gs4 a4 ~] [cs5 e5 fs5 e5 cs5 e5 fs5 e5 a4 b4 cs5 e5 b4 cs5 b4 ~] [e5 fs5 gs5 fs5 e5 cs5 b4 cs5 e5 fs5 e5 cs5 b4 a4 gs4 ~] [b4 e5 cs5 e5 b4 e5 cs5 b4 e5 cs5 b4 a4 ~ ~ ~ ~]>" # s "hoRhodes" # gain (slow 64 $ range 0.9 1.0 saw) # cutoff 4600 # release 0.9 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d8 $ silence

d9 $ slow 2 $ n "<[fs3,a4,cs5] [d3,fs4,d5] [a3,e4,cs5] [e3,b4,gs5]>" # s "hoRhodes" # gain 1.15 # cutoff 4200 # attack 0.03 # sustain 4 # release 2.6 # verbSend 0.35 # room 0.6 # size 0.7 # verbT60 4 # verbDamp 0.4 # ddSend 0

d10 $ silence

d11 $ silence

d12 $ silence
